flowchart LR
  subgraph offchain[Off-chain · JavaScript]
    B[Source BPMN] --> I[Importer<br/>import-bpmn.js]
    I --> D[NMT dataset<br/>.nmt.json]
    D --> M[choreography-model.js<br/>abi.encode]
    U[BPMN updates] --> A[apply-asset-delta.js]
    J[/tokenURI metadata<br/>JSON: roles + nodes/] -->|decode| R[Render<br/>web3.js + bpmn-builder-js]
    R --> X[Regenerated BPMN]
  end
  subgraph onchain[On-chain · Solidity]
    NMT[ChoreographyNMT<br/>ERC-721] -->|creates and owns| CMA[ChoreographyMutableAsset]
    MP[MasterSmartPolicy] -->|authorizes mint| NMT
    CP[CreatorSmartPolicy] -->|authorizes and constrains<br/>updates| CMA
    HP[HolderSmartPolicy] -->|second approval| CMA
    TR[ChoreographyTokenURIRenderer] -->|reads| CMA
    NMT -->|tokenURI| TR
    MC[Model contract<br/>SSTORE2] -->|read at mint| CMA
    NMT -.->|immutable| MC
  end
  M -->|deploys the code| MC
  A -->|setRoles + setNodes| CMA
  CMA -->|tokenURI| J
